    "lineage": "",
    "mech_note": "Pizza Sticks: 2-4 Totems channeling Flameblast to maximum stacking stages, then detonating for fire AoE, continuously — the community-named totem-channel archetype where the CHANNEL COMMITMENT is outsourced to stationary proxies. The player places totems, they begin charging Flameblast independently; when one detonates, it cycles back to charging. Multiple totems provide overlapping blast coverage. Passive tree: Ancestral Bond (no personal damage but unlimited totems) + Chieftain ascendancy (totem life, totem fire damage, Ngamahu's flame) or Hierophant (totem count + mana). The name 'Pizza Sticks' emerged from the visual of 4 charging Flameblast totems clustered together looking like breadsticks on the minimap. The identity: never press a damage button — place totems and reposition. Has been a reliable SSF starter for multiple leagues.",
